# Copy this file to llama-server.args (next to the script) and edit it.
# One llama serve option per line: "--option value" or "--option=value".
# Blank lines and lines starting with "#" are skipped.
# These override the script defaults; options on the command line override these.
# When both the model and the mmproj choice are set here, the TUI is skipped.

# --model /path/to/model.gguf
# --mmproj /path/to/mmproj.gguf
# --no-mmproj
# --port 8888
# --ctx-size=32768
